#: scenario6:scenario6_08BF130F_0290_4C6A_A6AE_394E277C5E1D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55d0e6097e3c8c6f4d109d2f9a24af4fa82153e26a7f284be1b2dfc1c3abd292
#. default-sha256: d570a87ac64e27792617c330700d19bc580c3aa6d1be9206c4e9ce93bf46452a
