msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9A86FC9B_89CD_40AF_AC2D_F93A8A50470C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2eb724cb9e08a74c650dc4b8c26e80d1a77caa1addfb09fbea8302c6fd379734
#. default-sha256: 073757becb02d92b02d2decee4f485295be65a86cc97a4fc6900d24a636ff55a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9A86FC9B_89CD_40AF_AC2D_F93A8A50470C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But it didn’t matter if it was all an illusion; ⟪k:1⟫the gentle breeze blowing in through "
"the window felt wonderful."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれども、⟪k:1⟫たとえ妄想だとしても――、⟪k:2⟫窓から吹き込む風はあまりに心地よくて。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_2BB1070F_5121_4B4C_87C2_E5392817163A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ff0978e2d448bfaf322046dbdfd4dd7df87f30f575a9a1853fc8241b9dd9af3
#. default-sha256: e2833575db2c6d82eb435fc4454063ef3079adf7bd3efd82b683a1e8fc07bfab
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2BB1070F_5121_4B4C_87C2_E5392817163A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The smell of grass, the chirping of birds, the glistening blue sky...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫it was like a "
"thousand memories rushing back all at once,⟪k:3⟫and it brought tears to my eyes."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫草の香り、⟪k:1⟫鳥の鳴き声、⟪k:2⟫きらきらと輝く青空……そのすべてが懐かしく。⟪k:3⟫わたしは思わ"
"ず、⟪k:4⟫涙を流しておりました。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_FEAE7690_F01A_4749_B284_1BBFF2039512
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 14d60e0d8a8bfdc87df233e5b4fcfbb493486f5a3ad2a36b757b4577ccf81415
#. default-sha256: 00ce5d27543f622236e888f946699eb1ed8ccb6ba97535262ec43e3b1c2ee19c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_FEAE7690_F01A_4749_B284_1BBFF2039512"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And as she always did, the witch’s voice crushed my elation,⟪k:1⟫dragging me back to reality."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫――わたしの感動を砕き、⟪k:1⟫現実に引き戻すのは、⟪k:2⟫いつも魔女の声です。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_F4C5E076_10F9_423D_AE33_EDC7C998E390
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ce6e3854fede4c294b8416b294c5760a6285a8a75f9589295b787c8ea864b6e
#. default-sha256: 24064e0d71fd8cf75df65118634a3c3354bab8fd3db7e935f795d889a4af9f12
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F4C5E076_10F9_423D_AE33_EDC7C998E390"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫for it was that moment that began my true decline."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたしの本当の転落の始まりだったのですから。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_24048DAB_589E_445E_9473_514B697F5F20
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c76a23602e3daed578c02d03b267a7a25ae88ab5c99f990e29c81a9d8c167c6a
#. default-sha256: 87bbe44ff2530bfff3cc0bfce7d9fa5a8b27d3fc72f503dc2a9d78a2fe4b0672
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_24048DAB_589E_445E_9473_514B697F5F20"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Have you already forgotten?⟪k:1⟫Oh, good heavens... ⟪k:2⟫Do you have your head on straight, "
"my dear?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫忘れてしまったの？　⟪k:1⟫まあ嫌だ……あなたの頭はきちんと働いているのでしょうか？"

#: scenario6:scenario6_9D80C2BC_6E8A_4074_B8A5_966D67262FB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e771b97c713fd2826c0c6b433a621fa802710d10af3cbc2b3c6891ae36640ac
#. default-sha256: d531751f86340fe337a7bbc3b525872a2f9247a2665a808f4502d78eaa25200a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_9D80C2BC_6E8A_4074_B8A5_966D67262FB5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...It looks like someone’s here."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫これはその準備に過ぎません。⟪k:1⟫……さあ、⟪k:2⟫誰か来たようですよ？"

#: scenario6:scenario6_5ECC5EC6_1C2A_4C00_8926_9D15828AFB8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea0379abd2c4e29ac353f07badabe55f404fc2ed3b8c29f0eaf8059fd410636a
