msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_AB61422F_38F0_4498_9F59_6F580BBF1977
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 936f01f8f476b475adfabd95aa9aef5a4cd366f5a386aee079e2da259e3d45a4
#. default-sha256: ce51e012cbd9ca2c9a9adb55a7dec2552966197d646c7b9bf80bd6705586a76f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_AB61422F_38F0_4498_9F59_6F580BBF1977"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫(The bar has been removed...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫（……閂が、⟪k:6⟫開いている……）"

#: scenario6:scenario6_14D5B97B_1F9B_4876_AF46_557077243F79
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ab45b3979e9206302f60e6df51e87fa3e679dce02dc4b984b6f68e7764bce5b
#. default-sha256: cb0dfb445e6d2223c85e55b41ecd115cb035c1300afd825b4e603ce4cfbc4efb
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_14D5B97B_1F9B_4876_AF46_557077243F79"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫…………。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_C90C966B_0C56_4001_9E0A_B23960B14CFB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0024c31e2fa082e0c48ea3a0f1d58b03ede6414e3bc3423f2b3808d3faae8b52
#. default-sha256: 763a1374b53c7b7f828286da2a59055fd8bb595971d3220bffa921146347d5dd
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C90C966B_0C56_4001_9E0A_B23960B14CFB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I felt like I had stepped into Heaven on Earth.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I know it sounds melodramatic, so "
"please don’t laugh."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたしには、⟪k:1⟫その光景が地上の楽園のように思えました。⟪k:2⟫大げさだと、⟪k:3⟫笑わないでくだ"
"さいね。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_0DA68A78_8B28_414F_AC1B_6DC4D5DE8857
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4042eb3b6eab630fd327809368902339a2ab448107b0b41e7a387e460037fa07
#. default-sha256: aea123a6245aecd2af1353b18c791a47b11ed8a582fc79823b709e58dd958a8a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_0DA68A78_8B28_414F_AC1B_6DC4D5DE8857"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I wondered where I was, of course, but I neither shouted nor jumped in surprise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫当然、⟪k:2⟫ここは一体どこなのだろうという疑問が湧きましたが、⟪k:3⟫驚いたり叫んだりするこ"
"ともなく――"

#: scenario6:scenario6_5AF7073A_DE35_4B5E_8F2F_E3EF7A7C5BEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e10f2ea70d9474e4f80c3f3fe70a3d190913a016778661917a2b0f3b5ae1a76c
#. default-sha256: f8fddbc77525022e4f572a7e2e3b5834293225cfd216d7f2b8341b99663730a0
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_5AF7073A_DE35_4B5E_8F2F_E3EF7A7C5BEB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Instead, I found myself accepting of my circumstances, as unnatural as they might have been."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その非常識な事態を、⟪k:1⟫受け止めようとしている自分がおりました。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_84026324_DC24_4E9D_A5A1_ECEADDA41B4D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9682947a3993a4215829309c20d54d66598cf77def2d22605c8785d55e5c0d71
#. default-sha256: d2eb840f76ee1a90032dffa85cb53bb397a02250a13befbddf551cef427497df
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_84026324_DC24_4E9D_A5A1_ECEADDA41B4D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫E⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫gad⟪k:7⟫... ⟪k:8⟫could this road be any bloody worse?⟪k:9⟫"
"⟪k:10⟫It’s in dire need of paving, on top of everything else..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫やれやれ……道中のひどさといったらないわい。⟪k:4⟫こりゃあ、⟪k:5⟫道の舗装もせにゃ"
"ならんなあ……。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_2AE98630_DED7_4A51_9FC8_3E63CEDD1BE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a5c78f0094169777fc22c73b742ec4b1f2d83fa6bcbaf9be397015999c0722e6
#. default-sha256: 706d586ba98dacb15a83ad4bbafed493a8d0c2ec6be0a92af543272748921801
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_2AE98630_DED7_4A51_9FC8_3E63CEDD1BE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(He’s speaking a different language...)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（言葉が、⟪k:1⟫ちがう………）"

#: scenario6:scenario6_AD7BDF71_DE74_4C0B_A019_0F4BC66C5C25
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57b2e0875c20d870d438280518024d4498d7efad0cbff8b5c6c165cc174541f4
#. default-sha256: f91aba050205694374bfff128ee3a1cee2bec509b424f45a375b5c4b479c8665
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_AD7BDF71_DE74_4C0B_A019_0F4BC66C5C25"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The middle-aged man approached me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From his attire and the way he held himself,⟪k:3⟫"
"he appeared to be upper-class."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫わたしの元に近付いてきたのは、⟪k:1⟫初老の男性でした。⟪k:2⟫身形や立ち振る舞いからして、⟪k:3⟫貴"
"い身分であることが分かります。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_D8A6A93F_8C97_4C40_BE00_67411E6A59E5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1364578de50ce980a1a1751dec2515e0e0eaee9d74f4efeb1d3da725b569b433
#. default-sha256: 1924759ac7dacae1c648585c5aab59785c46cd9ac4dc0861bbc6e9053c223511
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_D8A6A93F_8C97_4C40_BE00_67411E6A59E5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the words coming out of his mouth were not in the language I had grown up speaking."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれど彼の話す言語は、⟪k:1⟫わたしが慣れ親しんだものとは違ったのです。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_84959456_0539_4B5D_AF25_55E7A84A63C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e50d1f46c90c127515c48ec2cc2b1e958e26712cf3cf8d3ec6a41d2ed0c8a6b
#. default-sha256: d8c85965d8cbc5e443a9f1a70a36bcd4df582f8991afe414d8b7df2b71bd605a
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_84959456_0539_4B5D_AF25_55E7A84A63C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the longer I stood there staring at him absentmindedly, the more incredulous he became."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わたしが呆然としていればしている程、⟪k:1⟫その男性は不審なまなざしを向けてきます。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_8ADCDDB8_5600_41C6_A1AF_7B1F0729A20A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4576d8063dedba4194d8f0f677d41f1863db5bcd816124f408b621f930d372d0
#. default-sha256: b8820958e465b9627c08e48466ff87e1f0c54f686df841724ec9071f38003f0e
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_8ADCDDB8_5600_41C6_A1AF_7B1F0729A20A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Fortunately, I suppose, I was able to understand bits and pieces of what he had said."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫幸いというべきか、⟪k:1⟫わたしには、⟪k:2⟫彼の言葉が少し理解出来たのです。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_C0FF212D_9A8A_4FD9_B75B_B36E08296C84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb2d29217f0d415c2aa40f26e45c865d43781c4cf2ce8ea41e75c9f25d673164
#. default-sha256: 1c8893e69cfb67a2850b27f9fb34723fa60c7bb67921f0ea3029c035d5a821df
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_C0FF212D_9A8A_4FD9_B75B_B36E08296C84"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As merchants in the capital, my family did business with people from other countries, and as "
"a result, I had learned a handful of words."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ええ、⟪k:1⟫わたしは首都で商いをやっておりましたから、⟪k:2⟫外国の人間とも取引があったのです。"
"⟪k:3⟫その際に、⟪k:4⟫いくつかの言葉を覚えました。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_AC59AA1D_9A37_43DA_B6EB_7C8511AFCA3E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72cd13c75e1f9fe9ec1a8804a9fe11f2b7950273b313f76c1373459942902ff7
#. default-sha256: bf04d391bf5b473f4e048a6825c43346e5db3d0127ae3d8ab39efe617c213f2f
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_AC59AA1D_9A37_43DA_B6EB_7C8511AFCA3E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The problem was... ⟪k:1⟫it had been so long ago, I had no confidence whatsoever in my "
"ability to hold a conversation."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ただ、⟪k:1⟫とても昔のことですので……、⟪k:2⟫うまく話せる自信など、⟪k:3⟫毛ほどもありませんでした"
"けれど。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_DE67DD51_9738_4809_AAEF_55F0D3BC8BCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b1a22ea3fce9959c44aa2977e87e7732527866de3965acde652612665aa6a40b
#. default-sha256: 37b7fe9a2c68a2399f944f61cd44b278ea57b883c41372f8be0ac4f07c634eeb
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_DE67DD51_9738_4809_AAEF_55F0D3BC8BCA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I am... ⟪k:3⟫I am a servant..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫わ……、⟪k:1⟫わたしは……、⟪k:2⟫このお屋敷の使用人です……。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_8FC453C1_D9B9_4A17_85F8_0BED6E133217
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a42c9edfb6bdc0140904f996511b30184b41432157ac4bb8606b7c34ca0b7c8
#. default-sha256: bf65579aab95b5dd5f4f8ccacc4a8935f5d6d09283c872a464fe16c1bc8723ce
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_8FC453C1_D9B9_4A17_85F8_0BED6E133217"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...You weren’t informed?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Bloody hell. Off to a great start, I see.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Well, "
"what can you do, I guess..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫……書状が届いていないのか？　⟪k:1⟫先が思いやられるのう。⟪k:2⟫やれやれ、⟪k:3⟫致し方ない……。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_085A38AC_6F3D_4699_981C_C0B7E83EE3E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf6772705c0b21ef4b1ec02eaba1105a99bfec17ce14f1322afedf4b9eaed99d
#. default-sha256: 0e3e50677f07b69a40b7952bff583573b85f70410e7f23f455b2bf2a1b301f2c
msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_085A38AC_6F3D_4699_981C_C0B7E83EE3E8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He was also the first person I served under as the Maid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そして、⟪k:1⟫わたしが館の女中となってから、⟪k:2⟫初めてお仕えした人でございます。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_7B5A3137_2B46_4EC5_8D88_DAFFE5D554E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
