msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫His instruction may have been harsh, but it was human interaction. There were people around "
"that I could talk to, and that was wonderful."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そして、⟪k:1⟫彼の厳しさも――誰かと関わるということも、⟪k:2⟫人と話すことも、⟪k:3⟫すべてが喜びに"
