msgctxt "scenario6:scenario6_F661F155_EA2B_427A_9EEE_53214517940B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I’m sure you think I’m just a loud, obnoxious old man,⟪k:1⟫but I believe we met for a "
"reason, so I hope you’ll stick with me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫お前さんは儂を口うるさい爺だと思っているかもしれんが、⟪k:1⟫これも何かの縁じゃ。⟪k:2⟫最後まで"
"付き合いなさい。"

#: scenario6:scenario6_3088F00D_145C_43CE_95C2_2954B7E738B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
